{"v":4,"catch":"不相信任何人。拿走一切。","desc":"Thief Life Simulator 帶你進入一個充滿生機的城市陰影中，每個決定都至關重要。在這個充滿監控、鎖門和緊湊行程的世界裡，你的任務很簡單：潛入、盡可能多地偷取，然後悄無聲息地離開。選擇你的目標，仔細計劃，使用尖端科技或傳統手法進入、偷盜，並消失無蹤。\n\n主要特色：\n\t•\t從扒竊和車庫開始，逐步升級到豪宅入室盜竊。\n\t•\t每個行動都有後果。要麼迅速行動，要麼被捕。\n\t•\t高級的開鎖、潛行與滲透機制。\n\t•\t從新手到職業賊，每一步都是冒險的選擇。\n\t•\t潛入、清空、消失。絕不留痕。\n\n你會攀上犯罪階梯，還是最終坐牢？\nThief Life Simulator — 每一次行動都至關重要。","publisher":"BoggySoft","release":"2025-09-09","genres":["模擬","益智","街機","動作"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"輔15歳級","size":"Switch 2 1.2GB / Switch 1.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ea05cc4cc56ccf6917eb003cc6039ac91d3e86ff5e5d2b92404f65d2b8f2f2a7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b98e55d7214f7f5b440a81152d2811ebb1595d8102c42185783081f87960bf58.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9463095061032293a856baa3707857d284eb2db99c2e9932e9e16131f6991bee.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9a129f0f3cab1d61a4fb61e762b3a38aeb9c8db80d3647f53a7c233082eef642.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/cd4b2c8f0bfe403120d2db0ac3132311222b7c6464048b1f4224b344ad790581.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b0aa8efd1397766ead8ae6413b526aa9cfa94b6f742d97bcc82cb5c89e066c0e.jpg"],"titleId":"0100b3d023dea000","dlc":[{"id":"70050000073724","name":"THIEF LIFE SIMULATOR: New Flashlight","img":"6adec773742b5ad1081d4a73e7a872635c83b5a9f77d5d1d07d6c56e108354a4","date":"2026-05-21","mem":false}]}